              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p>The British Horror Film Festival returns for 2026, taking over Lumiere Cinema in Romford, London for one <strong><strong>unforgettable night of independent horror cinema</strong></strong><strong><strong>.</strong></strong></p><p>From chilling short film programmes to a feature presentations, BHFF celebrates the <strong><strong>fearless filmmakers</strong></strong> pushing the boundaries of the horror/thriller genres from around the world. The evening culminates in our Awards Ceremony, recognising the best of this year's submissions.</p><p><strong><strong>Date:</strong></strong> Saturday, 26 September 2026<br><strong><strong>Venue:</strong></strong> Lumiere Cinema, The Mercury Shopping Centre (Level 3), Romford RM1 3EE<br><strong><strong>What's Screening:</strong></strong> 4 individual screenings (with exclusive Q&amp;As by the filmmakers) &amp; an awards ceremony.</p>",
