            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p><br></p><p><strong><strong>The Lineup | </strong></strong><strong><strong>Check out the Lineup Here:</strong></strong><br><a href=\"https://www.filmfestivalguild.com/british-horror-film-festival\" title=\"https://www.filmfestivalguild.com/british-horror-film-festival\" target=\"_blank\" data-msys-clicktrack=\"0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">BHFF 2026 Official Selection</a></p><p><br></p><p><strong><strong>The Tickets</strong></strong><br><strong><strong>Full Festival Pass | £2</strong></strong><strong><strong>9.99</strong></strong> Your ticket to the full night. Covers all four film screenings and the Awards Ceremony. Best value for horror fans who want the complete BHFF experience.</p><p><strong><strong>Individual Screening </strong></strong><strong><strong>|</strong></strong><strong><strong> £9.99</strong></strong> Choose one or multiple screening slots to attend with four programmes to pick from - details announced August 14th.</p><ul><li>Screening 1 | 11am - Feature Film Screening \"Wrath of the Gods\"</li><li>Screening 2 | 2pm - Short Film Programme 1 (as detailed on our website)</li><li>Screening 3 | 5pm - Feature Film Screening \"JINX\"</li><li>Screening 4 &amp; Awards | 8pm Short Film Programme 2 (as detailed on our website)</li></ul><p><strong><strong>VIP Festival Pass </strong></strong><strong><strong>|</strong></strong><strong><strong> £49.99</strong></strong> The full festival experience with all four screenings &amp; awards ceremony included plus reserved seating, custom VIP lanyard, and welcome drink. Limited availability, early booking recommended.</p>",
